hing.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "The sea heaves.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "Spray.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Silence.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "His phone on the dash lights up.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "ON PHONE (TEXT): dad. please come home.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "He turns it face-down.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}]}